WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:04.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt;&gt; BIGFOOT.
THE LOCH NESS MONSTER.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:08.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
ALL RARELY SEEN.
ALL SHROUDED IN MYSTERY.

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:09.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
TONIGHT WE'RE HEADED TO THE
WOODS OF WESTCHESTER COUNTY TO

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.044
SEARCH FOR THE MOST ELUSIVE
LEGEND OF ALL, HILLARY RODHAM

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
CLINTON.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.987
&gt;&gt; WAIT, DID YOU HEAR THAT?
&gt;&gt; WITH MY PARTNER, COOP DIXON.

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:25.125
&gt;&gt; THERE'S SOMETHING HERE, MAN!
&gt;&gt; THIS IS "THE HUNT FOR HILL."

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
OUR SEARCH BEGINS IN THE WOODS
OF CHAPPAQUA WHERE HILLARY

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:30.363
CLINTON HAS RECENTLY BEEN
SIGHTED BY A BUNCH OF WHITE

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
PEOPLE WITH FACEBOOK ACCOUNTS.
WHERE WAS SHE NOW?

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
WE SET OUT TO FIND HER.
TRAP HER.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:42.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND THANK HER.
AND FOR THAT WE NEEDED HELP.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SO MICHELLE, YOU'VE SEEN
HILLARY CLINTON?

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:50.150
&gt;&gt; I HAVE.
I WAS IN MY KITCHEN WASHING PANS

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:56.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHEN I SAW SOMETHING MOVING
THROUGH THE WOODS.

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
IT WAS BLOND, ABOUT 5'6".

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.060
IT SEEMED LIKE IT KIND OF WANTED
?

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:04.497
TIME TO ITSELF SO I IMMEDIATELY
STARTED RUNNING AFTER IT.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:07.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HEY, WAIT!
I JUST WANT TO THANK YOU!

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE WELCOME.
&gt;&gt; HILLARY!

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
HILLARY, WAIT!
I THINK IT'S HER.

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S HER.
YOU DID A GREAT JOB.

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:15.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WE DECIDED TO CHECK OUT THE
SPOT WHERE MICHELLE HAD HER

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.478
SIGHTING TO SEE IF THERE WAS ANY
TRACE OF HILL.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HEY, RAFE?
YOU'RE GOING TO WANT TO SEE

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:23.850
THIS.
&gt;&gt; THAT IS A WOMAN'S SHOE RIGHT

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:29.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
THERE SIZE 6.
LOOK, SEE HOW THERE'S NO HEEL?

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:30.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT'S HILLARY.
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:34.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SHE WAS DEFINITELY CLOSE.
SO I DECIDED TO TRY AND

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:38.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
COMMUNICATE WITH HER.
&gt;&gt; HA HA HA HA!

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:41.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
&gt;&gt; SHH!

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
HA HA HA HA!
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT GOING TO WORK.

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:53.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; JUST HOLD ON.
HA HA HA HA!

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:57.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HA HA HA HA!
&gt;&gt; WE COULD HEAR HER LAUGH BUT

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:00.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
WE COULDN'T SEE HER.
AND IT WAS GETTING DARK SO WE

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:04.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
DECIDED TO LURE HER TO US WITH
THE ONE THING WE KNEW WOULD

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:07.494
ENTICE HER, AN ARTICLE ABOUT THE
RECOUNT IN WISCONSIN.

00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:10.263
WE PLACED IT AT THE EDGE OF THE
WOODS, SET UP OUR NIGHT VISION,

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:18.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND WAITED.
SHE NEVER SHOWED.

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:21.141
BUT THE NEXT MORNING WHEN WE
CHECKED, THE ARTICLE HAD CLEARLY

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:23.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
BEEN READ.
BECAUSE IN THE VERY BOTTOM

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:26.146
CORNER THERE WAS A LITTLE NOTE.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S OUR GAL.

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:32.118
&gt;&gt; THAT SAID "THANK YOU, H."
IT WAS OUR LAST DAY IN CHAPPAQUA

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:39.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND WE HAD JUST ONE MORE IDEA.
BUT IT WAS A CRAZY ONE.

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:41.528
&gt;&gt; HELLO?
&gt;&gt; YOU SAY YOU ARE ONE WITH THE

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:44.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
TREES.
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
I HAVE LIVED MY WHOLE LIFE IN
THESE CHAPPAQUA WOODS.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.002
THE TREES WHISPER THEIR SECRETS
TO ME.

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU ASK THEM WHERE
HILLARY CLINTON IS?

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:57.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE.
ONE MOMENT.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:03:05.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ GIBBERISH ]
HA HA HA HA!

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:09.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
OH!
SHE'S BUYING EGGS AT A GROCERY

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:13.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
STORE.
&gt;&gt; NEXT WEEK, THE SEARCH MOVES

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:17.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
TO A SHOP RITE.
ONLY ON "THE HUNT FOR HILL."

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:18.398 size:84% position:42%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

